"\n\n\n\n\n## Review\nA cafe famous for its Mont Blanc Coffee.  \nIt's a signature menu that went viral on social media — filter coffee topped with fresh cream, nutmeg, and orange zest, with a visually striking presentation.\n\nThe taste was honestly familiar, but I happened to be craving something sweet at the right moment, so it hit the spot.\n\nThe cafe was already full inside, so I was about to get takeout, but luckily an outdoor table opened up and I got to sit down and enjoy it properly.  \nI also ordered a sandwich to make it a quick meal.\n\nThey operate as a cafe during the day and a cocktail bar in the evening.  \nA great spot to drop by for a break if you're in the area.  \n## Pictures\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"